==========================================================
sWire: Special wire (equivalent to DEF SPECIALNETS wiring)
----------------------------------------------------------
area: area, Area of the special wire as defined by the LEF MACRO SIZE or OVERLAP information
beginExt: coord, Extension of path at the first point (only on path type)
box(settable): rect, Bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
boxTrimMetal: rect, The box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_area: area, Area of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_ll: pt, Lower left (ll) of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_llx: coord, Lower left X (llx) of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_lly: coord, Lower left Y (lly) of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_size: pt, Size of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_sizex: coord, Size X of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_sizey: coord, Size Y of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_ur: pt, Upper right (ur) of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_urx: coord, Upper Right X (urx) of the box of this special wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_ury: coord, Upper Right Y (ury) of the box of this special wire trim metal
box_area: area, Area of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_ll(settable): pt, Lower left (ll) of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_llx(settable): coord, Lower left X (llx) of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_lly(settable): coord, Lower left Y (lly) of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_size(settable): pt, Size of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_sizex(settable): coord, Size X of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_sizey(settable): coord, Size Y of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_ur(settable): pt, Upper right (ur) of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_urx(settable): coord, Upper Right X (urx) of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
box_ury(settable): coord, Upper Right Y (ury) of bounding box for shapes, actual shape for geomType = rect
colorTrimMetal: int, The color of this specical wire trim metal
endExt: coord, Extension of path at the last point (only on path type)
geomType: enum(path pathSeg poly rect), Type of shape (rect, polygon, etc.)
hasTrimMetal: bool, Indicates the speical wire has trim metal or not
isPatch: bool, Indicates the special wire is patch wire
layer(settable): obj(layer), Pointer to layer
mask(settable): int, Indicates mask number for multiple mask layer usage. Refer to layer's .numMask attribute for legal range, 0 indicates uncolored.
net: obj(net), Pointer to net that the sWire belongs to
objType: enum(antennaData antennaModel bndry bump bumpGrid bumpTerm bus busGuide busSinkGroup cellDensity densityShape fPlan foreign gCellGridDef group guiLine guiPoly guiRect guiText hInst hInstTerm hNet hTerm head inst instTerm io layer layerRule layerShape libCell marker net netGroup pBlkg pWire pd pgInstTerm pin pinGroup pinGuide pinShape pkgComponent pkgObject prop ptn ptnCell ptnPinBlkg rBlkg resistor resizeBlkg routeType row rule sViaInst sWire sdp shape shapeVia site stackViaRule term text topCell trackDef vCell vWire via viaInst viaRuleGenerate whatIfVia whatIfWire wire), Object type: Special Wire
polyPts: list(pt), Polygon boundary for the object, the first point is not repeated as the last point in the list
props: objList(prop), List of pointers to properties
pts: list(pt), 2 points for pathSeg center-line, n points for path center-line, n points for polygon, null for rect
shape(settable): enum(blockRing blockagewire blockwire corewire drcfill fillopc fillwire followpin iowire notype padRing ring stripe), DEF SPECIALNETS + SHAPE equivalents (ring, stripe, etc.)
shieldNet: obj(net), Pointer to net that is shielded if status is shieldNet
status(settable): enum(cover fixed routed shield unknown), Wiring status (equivalent to DEF SPECIALNETS special wiring status)
userClass(settable): string, Subclass value ({} is returned if no subClass is specified)
width(settable): coord, Width of path/pathSeg type
